// `map`/`filter`/`sum` are free functions, not list methods — calling one as a method (`xs.map(f)`)
// is an unknown method, reported `UnknownName` (E0005) identically on both backends. (Previously the
// tree-walker misreported this as `TypeMismatch` "takes no arguments"; the differential surfaced it.)
// expect: error E0005 at 7:6
// expect: exit 1
xs = [1, 2, 3]
echo xs.map(fn(v) => v)
